\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30,000 - 150,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 14, 2004<br/>Christmas Update 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060527110606&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Helmet_of_the_Ancients_1e7d39.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a helmet of the ancients <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:8)</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 27.60 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">The gem of the helmet is burned out and should be replaced.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">Pharaohs</a> guard the pieces of the helmet. When you use it on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a>, it will be enchanted and turn into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Ancients%20%28Enchanted%29\">Helmet of the Ancients (Enchanted)</a>, which has an additional 3 armor. This effect will only last for 30 minutes. According to this book, using a Soul Ruby will permanently increase this value.<br/><br/>\nObtained through <a href=\"#/quest/the-ancient-tombs-quest\">The Ancient Tombs Quest</a>.<br/><br/>\nEnchanting this helmet with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> will grant you the achievement Hidden Powers.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Rune\">Ancient Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ashmunrah\">Ashmunrah</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Note\">Blue Note</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burning%20Heart\">Burning Heart</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cobrafang%20Dagger\">Cobrafang Dagger</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Arrow\">Crystal Arrow</a></li><li>Demon Trophy (Immobile)</li><li>Dwarven Set</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Ancients%20%28Enchanted%29\">Helmet of the Ancients (Enchanted)</a></li><li>Hidden Powers</li><li>Legacy of the Tombs (Book)</li><li>Morgathla</li><li>Morgathla Reveals the Secrets of the Mask (Book)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ornamented%20Ankh\">Ornamented Ankh</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">Pharaohs</a></li><li>Quests</li><li>Recovering the Secret of the Mask (Book)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus%20%28Quest%29\">Sarcophagus (Quest)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a></li><li>Soul Ruby</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sword%20Hilt\">Sword Hilt</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-ancient-tombs-quest\">The Ancient Tombs Quest</a></li><li>Tibia Language</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-ancient-tombs-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-ancient-tombs-quest","quest":"The Ancient Tombs Quest","step":"8-7","n":76,"title":"Montar o capacete","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}